hich makes it stand out from the other options. The other options, while they are all part of the body, have less distinct appearances in a CT image, with the bronchus and spinal cord appearing as tube-like structures and the breast as a soft tissue mass, and the thoracic cavity appearing as a large empty space.", "answer": "C"}
